## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to implement cross-cloud least privilege, ABAC, and rapid incident response in a real-world multi-cloud data platform.

## Key Concepts
- Least privilege in multi-cloud IAM
- ABAC and IAM Conditions across AWS/GCP
- Ephemeral credentials and workload identity federation
- CI gates for RBAC drift
- 24-hour incident response playbooks and log correlation

## Code Example
